{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1503332-chimerical-vehicles","id":1503332,"title":"Chimerical Vehicles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-17T10:54:52-08:00","id":1503332,"title":"Chimerical Vehicles","content":"I'm sorry if this is a dumb question, but I've always wondered about Chimerical Vehicles. Like, does a Chimerical Ship need some Autumn Fishing Trawler or something to build itself around? Or can Changelings manning a Chimerical Ship just be on a Chimerical Ship that has no 'real' 'foundation.' If the later, what does it look like to mortals and Prodigals who can't see Chimera? If a Nocker has a Chimerical Zeppelin, does it need to be built around a hot air balloon?<br /> <br /> I'm sorry for the dumb, over-thinking question, but I've had this question for decades. Thanks in advance!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-18T11:34:28-08:00","id":1503392,"title":"","content":"The question is, do you expect unenchanted people to see your vehicle? If they will, as described on page 55, their disbelief can cause the chimerical vehicle to fail, which in the case of a high speed chase or a high altitude zeppelin is likely to be catastrophic.<br /> <br /> If they won't see you, whether by careful journey planning or by Chicanery or other arts, then you have nothing to worry about. Feel free to fly around on a winged tricycle without a care in the world.<br /> <br /> If you are seen by people who cannot perceive chimera then what they see needs to make sense. You don't need to attach your chimerical zeppelin to a real zeppelin, just to something that looks like it can carry what your zeppelin can carry. A life sized model of a hot air balloon will do fine, just don't let people get up close to realise it's not real. Alternatively feel free to use Primal 2 to surround it with a cloud.<br /> <br /> If all else fails and your purely chimerical vehicle is going to be seen by a crowd of people, call on the wyrd and worry about how to explain it later. Experts will come up with new terms like Mass Formation Psychosis or whatever to explain how you seemed to land a dragon into the superbowl final stadium and hunters will be on your tail for weeks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13395-daniel-knight","name":"Daniel Knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-18T21:43:29-08:00","id":1503423,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daniel Knight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1503332-chimerical-vehicles?p=1503392#post1503392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The question is, do you expect unenchanted people to see your vehicle? If they will, as described on page 55, their disbelief can cause the chimerical vehicle to fail, which in the case of a high speed chase or a high altitude zeppelin is likely to be catastrophic.<br /> <br /> If they won't see you, whether by careful journey planning or by Chicanery or other arts, then you have nothing to worry about. Feel free to fly around on a winged tricycle without a care in the world.<br /> <br /> If you are seen by people who cannot perceive chimera then what they see needs to make sense. You don't need to attach your chimerical zeppelin to a real zeppelin, just to something that looks like it can carry what your zeppelin can carry. A life sized model of a hot air balloon will do fine, just don't let people get up close to realise it's not real. Alternatively feel free to use Primal 2 to surround it with a cloud.<br /> <br /> If all else fails and your purely chimerical vehicle is going to be seen by a crowd of people, call on the wyrd and worry about how to explain it later. Experts will come up with new terms like Mass Formation Psychosis or whatever to explain how you seemed to land a dragon into the superbowl final stadium and hunters will be on your tail for weeks.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;It's just a chinese spy balloon&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-20T10:33:53-08:00","id":1503531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_qu